#: ../../library/traceback.rst:674
msgid ""
"The following example shows the different ways to print and format the "
"stack::"
msgstr ""
"O exemplo seguinte mostra as diferentes formas de apresentar e formatar a "
"pilha::"

#: ../../library/traceback.rst:676
msgid ""
">>> import traceback\n"
